{"id":"CUBRID-C003","claim_ko":"FLUSHING_TO_DISK는 victim/reuse와 동시 두 번째 flush를 막지만 page content를 freeze하지 않는다. flush 시작 때 기존 DIRTY를 지워 I/O 중 writer의 새 DIRTY 세대를 구분하고, 성공 시 FLUSHING만 지워 재더티를 보존한다.","database":"cubrid","revision":"f799e05d77d5300c6ea5753b4a6cc7caee6d8912","kind":"source","confidence":"SOURCE-CONFIRMED","source_refs":[{"path":"src/storage/page_buffer.c","symbol":"pgbuf_bcb_safe_flush_internal","line_start":8810,"line_end":8902,"file_sha256":"d1e71931b2a2da569f7e96c8a35eab85ec5bf0b4dac5fa0c3d0ac69adf03c163","evidence_state":"COMMIT"},{"path":"src/storage/page_buffer.c","symbol":"pgbuf_bcb_mark_is_flushing","line_start":16077,"line_end":16125,"file_sha256":"d1e71931b2a2da569f7e96c8a35eab85ec5bf0b4dac5fa0c3d0ac69adf03c163","evidence_state":"COMMIT"}],"runtime_run_ids":[],"limitations_ko":"checkpoint의 conservative reflush와 모든 caller 분기는 본 문장의 범위 밖이다.","report_locations":["chapters/03-interface-ownership.html#data-ownership-lifetime","chapters/04-current-flush.html#snapshot-copy-flush","chapters/04-current-flush.html#lifecycle-state-machines","chapters/05-concurrency-durability.html#concurrency"]}
{"id":"CUBRID-C004","claim_ko":"CUBRID flush는 snapshot page LSA까지 WAL을 data/DWB write보다 먼저 flush하며, common write 실패 시 FLUSHING을 지우고 원 DIRTY와 oldest_unflush_lsa를 보수적으로 복원한 뒤 waiter를 깨운다.","database":"cubrid","revision":"f799e05d77d5300c6ea5753b4a6cc7caee6d8912","kind":"source","confidence":"SOURCE-CONFIRMED","source_refs":[{"path":"src/storage/page_buffer.c","symbol":"logpb_flush_log_for_wal","line_start":10836,"line_end":10923,"file_sha256":"d1e71931b2a2da569f7e96c8a35eab85ec5bf0b4dac5fa0c3d0ac69adf03c163","evidence_state":"COMMIT"}],"runtime_run_ids":[],"limitations_ko":"TDE/초기 DWB slot 실패의 조기 return은 CUBRID-C010에서 분리한다.","report_locations":["chapters/03-interface-ownership.html#scope-interface-seams","chapters/04-current-flush.html#snapshot-copy-flush","chapters/04-current-flush.html#lifecycle-state-machines","chapters/05-concurrency-durability.html#storage-durability","chapters/06-policy.html#errors-resource-pressure","chapters/11-blueprint.html#reimplementation-blueprint"]}
