{"id":"CUBRID-C006","claim_ko":"pinned debug build의 동일 SQL 3회 실행은 매회 20000 rows와 양의 data-page dirty counter를 만들었고, 세 workload·background activity·online-backup trigger를 포함한 active observation window에서 global Num_data_page_iowrites가 0에서 3으로 증가했다.","database":"cubrid","revision":"f799e05d77d5300c6ea5753b4a6cc7caee6d8912","kind":"source+runtime","confidence":"SOURCE+RUNTIME-CONFIRMED","source_refs":[{"path":"src/transaction/log_page_buffer.c","symbol":"logpb_backup_for_volume","line_start":7471,"line_end":7525,"file_sha256":"98dbfb055d2370ab7a98334de328bebc46c1828c0e04e2ea80a7d14e8472ef9c","evidence_state":"COMMIT"}],"runtime_run_ids":["exp-flush-run-1","exp-flush-run-2","exp-flush-run-3","exp-statdump-before","exp-backupdb-checkpoint","exp-statdump-after"],"limitations_ko":"0→3을 online-backup preflush 하나에 귀속할 수 없다. DWB, background/system activity가 섞이고 unique logical page 수가 아니며 runtime은 memcpy, WAL 순서, exact error branch를 직접 증명하지 않는다.","report_locations":["index.html#evidence-summary","chapters/04-current-flush.html#snapshot-copy-flush","chapters/06-policy.html#stable-frame-io-contract","chapters/07-experiment.html#experimental-validation","chapters/12-glossary-teaching.html#teaching-map"]}
{"id":"CUBRID-C007","claim_ko":"[설계 추론] 모든 page mutation이 WRITE 계약을 지킨다는 전제에서, flusher가 READ fix를 보유한 채 synchronous live-frame write를 하고 반환 후 unfix하면 READ가 writer를 막고 fix가 replacement를 막으므로 SX는 정확성의 필수 조건이 아니다.","database":"cubrid","revision":"f799e05d77d5300c6ea5753b4a6cc7caee6d8912","kind":"inference","confidence":"INFERRED","source_refs":[{"path":"src/storage/page_buffer.c","symbol":"pgbuf_latch_bcb_upon_fix","line_start":6298,"line_end":6537,"file_sha256":"d1e71931b2a2da569f7e96c8a35eab85ec5bf0b4dac5fa0c3d0ac69adf03c163","evidence_state":"COMMIT"},{"path":"src/storage/page_buffer.h","symbol":"PGBUF_LATCH_MODE","line_start":189,"line_end":203,"file_sha256":"2f052cd4be1df289692990973dcb30f332bd75f5b135ea367a5960e866c9b197","evidence_state":"COMMIT"}],"runtime_run_ids":[],"limitations_ko":"prototype은 없고 synchronous call interval만의 결론이다. READ 없이 바꾸는 writer나 다른 재사용 경로가 있으면 반증된다.","report_locations":["index.html#answer","chapters/01-orientation.html#orientation","chapters/05-concurrency-durability.html#concurrency","chapters/06-policy.html#policy-recommendation"]}
