{"id":"CUBRID-C016","claim_ko":"CUBRID leaf record는 첫 OID slotid의 상위 0x2000 bit로 overflow OID 존재를 표시하고 record 꼬리에 chain head VPID를 둔다. link 제거 시 VPID와 flag를 함께 지운다. 각 overflow header는 next VPID 하나만 가지며 런타임 증설은 새 OID를 담은 page를 leaf 바로 뒤의 새 head로 삽입한다.","database":"cubrid","revision":"f799e05d77d5300c6ea5753b4a6cc7caee6d8912","kind":"source","confidence":"SOURCE-CONFIRMED","source_refs":[{"path":"src/storage/btree.c","symbol":"BTREE_LEAF_RECORD_OVERFLOW_OIDS","line_start":113,"line_end":122,"file_sha256":"547c44afb9ed2d86eca95744b3118ab5eee566ba48a779690ffe92abc75993b3","evidence_state":"COMMIT"},{"path":"src/storage/btree.c","symbol":"btree_leaf_get_vpid_for_overflow_oids","line_start":2301,"line_end":2322,"file_sha256":"547c44afb9ed2d86eca95744b3118ab5eee566ba48a779690ffe92abc75993b3","evidence_state":"COMMIT"},{"path":"src/storage/btree.c","symbol":"btree_leaf_record_change_overflow_link","line_start":2326,"line_end":2393,"file_sha256":"547c44afb9ed2d86eca95744b3118ab5eee566ba48a779690ffe92abc75993b3","evidence_state":"COMMIT"},{"path":"src/storage/btree.c","symbol":"btree_leaf_record_handle_first_overflow","line_start":3033,"line_end":3103,"file_sha256":"547c44afb9ed2d86eca95744b3118ab5eee566ba48a779690ffe92abc75993b3","evidence_state":"COMMIT"},{"path":"src/storage/btree_load.h","symbol":"BTREE_OVERFLOW_HEADER","line_start":240,"line_end":245,"file_sha256":"903399cf73391b907b621f53af737e1dadbed5dc0c19e67c4ccf3837e86323c5","evidence_state":"COMMIT"},{"path":"src/storage/btree.c","symbol":"btree_start_overflow_page","line_start":3977,"line_end":4025,"file_sha256":"547c44afb9ed2d86eca95744b3118ab5eee566ba48a779690ffe92abc75993b3","evidence_state":"COMMIT"}],"runtime_run_ids":[],"limitations_ko":"100만 OID의 정확한 page 수는 page 크기, slot overhead와 MVCC record shape에 따라 달라 본 Claim에 수치로 고정하지 않는다.","report_locations":["chapters/06-policy.html#btree-overflow-oid-case","chapters/10-comparison.html#cross-database-comparison","chapters/12-glossary-teaching.html#glossary","chapters/12-glossary-teaching.html#teaching-map"]}
{"id":"CUBRID-C017","claim_ko":"literal CREATE INDEX bulk loader는 현재 overflow tail을 직접 이어 붙이지만, 이후 DML의 free-page helper는 leaf WRITE를 보유한 채 head부터 overflow page를 하나씩 WRITE fix한다. full page에서는 next VPID를 복사한 뒤 unfix하고, 공간을 찾은 page는 WRITE-latched 상태로 반환해 같은 latch 아래 삽입한다. helper 경로는 bt_fix_ovf_oids counter/timer로 묶어 관측한다.","database":"cubrid","revision":"f799e05d77d5300c6ea5753b4a6cc7caee6d8912","kind":"source","confidence":"SOURCE-CONFIRMED","source_refs":[{"path":"src/storage/btree_load.c","symbol":"bt_load_nospace_for_new_oid","line_start":2746,"line_end":2842,"file_sha256":"10df7dd17ef3c31836ad658ab094e95234f0a7c2cf0a1bb9e41330f88087c202","evidence_state":"COMMIT"},{"path":"src/storage/btree.c","symbol":"btree_perf_ovf_oids_fix_time","line_start":932,"line_end":936,"file_sha256":"547c44afb9ed2d86eca95744b3118ab5eee566ba48a779690ffe92abc75993b3","evidence_state":"COMMIT"},{"path":"src/base/perf_monitor.c","symbol":"PSTAT_BT_FIX_OVF_OIDS","line_start":382,"line_end":384,"file_sha256":"3c23ce773eb1694796ff004af13a0bc3512386ca464f00e91b6f47ed3b4a66a0","evidence_state":"COMMIT"},{"path":"src/storage/btree.c","symbol":"btree_find_free_overflow_oids_page","line_start":12137,"line_end":12179,"file_sha256":"547c44afb9ed2d86eca95744b3118ab5eee566ba48a779690ffe92abc75993b3","evidence_state":"COMMIT"},{"path":"src/storage/btree.c","symbol":"btree_key_insert_new_object","line_start":28862,"line_end":28884,"file_sha256":"547c44afb9ed2d86eca95744b3118ab5eee566ba48a779690ffe92abc75993b3","evidence_state":"COMMIT"},{"path":"src/storage/btree.c","symbol":"btree_key_append_object_into_ovf","line_start":30051,"line_end":30112,"file_sha256":"547c44afb9ed2d86eca95744b3118ab5eee566ba48a779690ffe92abc75993b3","evidence_state":"COMMIT"}],"runtime_run_ids":[],"limitations_ko":"helper 내부 overflow latch는 최대 한 장이지만 leaf WRITE는 외부에서 계속 보유한다. 찾은 page를 놓지 않으므로 반환 뒤 공간 경쟁 재검증 race는 없다. timer는 helper 전체 시간이지 page별 fix count, chain length나 latch wait 증명이 아니다.","report_locations":["chapters/06-policy.html#btree-overflow-oid-case","chapters/07-experiment.html#performance-observability","chapters/10-comparison.html#cross-database-comparison","chapters/12-glossary-teaching.html#glossary","chapters/12-glossary-teaching.html#teaching-map"]}
{"id":"CUBRID-C018","claim_ko":"[소스 기반 복잡도 추론] free-page helper 한 호출의 최악 비용은 chain length K에 대해 O(K)이지만, 런타임 새 page가 head에 들어가므로 그 head에 공간이 있는 일반 append는 첫 page에서 끝난다. 긴 scan은 head-full 증설 시점, bulk-built partial tail 또는 깊은 fragmentation에서 나타날 수 있다.","database":"cubrid","revision":"f799e05d77d5300c6ea5753b4a6cc7caee6d8912","kind":"inference","confidence":"INFERRED","source_refs":[{"path":"src/storage/btree.c","symbol":"btree_start_overflow_page","line_start":3977,"line_end":4025,"file_sha256":"547c44afb9ed2d86eca95744b3118ab5eee566ba48a779690ffe92abc75993b3","evidence_state":"COMMIT"},{"path":"src/storage/btree_load.c","symbol":"bt_load_nospace_for_new_oid","line_start":2746,"line_end":2842,"file_sha256":"10df7dd17ef3c31836ad658ab094e95234f0a7c2cf0a1bb9e41330f88087c202","evidence_state":"COMMIT"},{"path":"src/storage/btree.c","symbol":"btree_find_free_overflow_oids_page","line_start":12137,"line_end":12178,"file_sha256":"547c44afb9ed2d86eca95744b3118ab5eee566ba48a779690ffe92abc75993b3","evidence_state":"COMMIT"}],"runtime_run_ids":[],"limitations_ko":"실제 page capacity, scan 분포와 latency spike는 측정하지 않았다. append/delete/vacuum workload와 bulk tail fill 상태에 따라 빈도는 달라진다.","report_locations":["chapters/06-policy.html#btree-overflow-oid-case","chapters/07-experiment.html#performance-observability","chapters/12-glossary-teaching.html#teaching-map"]}
{"id":"CUBRID-C019","claim_ko":"unique index에도 MVCC physical version이 공존하면 overflow OID가 생길 수 있다. unique+overflow assertion은 이를 금지하지 않고 첫 OID의 CLASS_OID flag를 요구하며, unique insert에는 마지막 object를 overflow로 옮기는 경로가 있다.","database":"cubrid","revision":"f799e05d77d5300c6ea5753b4a6cc7caee6d8912","kind":"source","confidence":"SOURCE-CONFIRMED","source_refs":[{"path":"src/storage/btree.c","symbol":"BTREE_LEAF_RECORD_OVERFLOW_OIDS","line_start":3005,"line_end":3008,"file_sha256":"547c44afb9ed2d86eca95744b3118ab5eee566ba48a779690ffe92abc75993b3","evidence_state":"COMMIT"},{"path":"src/storage/btree.c","symbol":"btree_key_append_object_unique","line_start":29784,"line_end":29831,"file_sha256":"547c44afb9ed2d86eca95744b3118ab5eee566ba48a779690ffe92abc75993b3","evidence_state":"COMMIT"},{"path":"src/storage/btree.c","symbol":"btree_key_relocate_last_into_ovf","line_start":29898,"line_end":29948,"file_sha256":"547c44afb9ed2d86eca95744b3118ab5eee566ba48a779690ffe92abc75993b3","evidence_state":"COMMIT"},{"path":"src/storage/btree.c","symbol":"btree_leaf_record_handle_first_overflow","line_start":3033,"line_end":3137,"file_sha256":"547c44afb9ed2d86eca95744b3118ab5eee566ba48a779690ffe92abc75993b3","evidence_state":"COMMIT"}],"runtime_run_ids":[],"limitations_ko":"한 논리 key에 매우 많은 visible rows가 몰리는 대표 사례는 non-unique 저카디널리티 index지만 구현을 non-unique 전용으로 일반화하면 안 된다.","report_locations":["chapters/06-policy.html#btree-overflow-oid-case"]}
{"id":"CUBRID-C020","claim_ko":"[설계 추론] overflow traversal을 reader-compatible single-modifier SX로 바꾸고 target에서 latch를 유지한 채 WRITE로 올리면 overflow reader와의 충돌을 줄이고 경쟁 promoter에 따른 실패·재시작을 피할 수 있다. 그러나 이는 신규 reader gate, 기존 reader drain, page당 단일 SX와 무교착 latch order가 보장될 때의 eventual upgrade이며 즉시·무조건 성공이 아니다.","database":"cubrid","revision":"f799e05d77d5300c6ea5753b4a6cc7caee6d8912","kind":"inference","confidence":"INFERRED","source_refs":[{"path":"src/storage/page_buffer.h","symbol":"PGBUF_LATCH_MODE","line_start":189,"line_end":209,"file_sha256":"2f052cd4be1df289692990973dcb30f332bd75f5b135ea367a5960e866c9b197","evidence_state":"COMMIT"},{"path":"src/storage/btree.c","symbol":"btree_find_free_overflow_oids_page","line_start":12137,"line_end":12179,"file_sha256":"547c44afb9ed2d86eca95744b3118ab5eee566ba48a779690ffe92abc75993b3","evidence_state":"COMMIT"},{"path":"src/storage/btree.c","symbol":"btree_key_insert_new_object","line_start":28862,"line_end":28884,"file_sha256":"547c44afb9ed2d86eca95744b3118ab5eee566ba48a779690ffe92abc75993b3","evidence_state":"COMMIT"},{"path":"src/storage/btree.c","symbol":"btree_range_scan_select_visible_oids","line_start":26707,"line_end":27003,"file_sha256":"547c44afb9ed2d86eca95744b3118ab5eee566ba48a779690ffe92abc75993b3","evidence_state":"COMMIT"}],"runtime_run_ids":[],"limitations_ko":"current revision에는 SX가 없다. standard range scan은 leaf READ를 유지하고 insert는 leaf WRITE를 먼저 잡으므로 overflow-only SX 효과가 upstream leaf conflict에 가릴 수 있으며 exhaustive caller audit도 미완이다.","report_locations":["chapters/06-policy.html#btree-overflow-oid-case","chapters/12-glossary-teaching.html#glossary","chapters/12-glossary-teaching.html#teaching-map"]}
{"id":"CUBRID-C021","claim_ko":"[미해결] overflow-only SX가 실제 insert throughput, reader latency 또는 tail latency를 개선하는지는 측정되지 않았다. O(K) chain walk, fix/unfix, leaf WRITE hold와 same-leaf writer serialization은 그대로 남는다.","database":"cubrid","revision":"f799e05d77d5300c6ea5753b4a6cc7caee6d8912","kind":"unknown","confidence":"UNKNOWN","source_refs":[],"runtime_run_ids":[],"limitations_ko":"bulk-built chain, runtime-only append와 fragmentation workload에서 방문 page 수, leaf/overflow latch wait와 SX-to-W wait를 분리한 prototype A/B가 필요하다. 기존 experiment-1은 이 Claim을 검증하지 않는다.","report_locations":["chapters/06-policy.html#btree-overflow-oid-case","chapters/07-experiment.html#performance-observability","chapters/12-glossary-teaching.html#glossary","chapters/12-glossary-teaching.html#teaching-map"]}
{"id":"PG-C007","claim_ko":"PostgreSQL nbtree는 logical duplicate를 heap TID tiebreaker로 정렬하고 page-local bounded posting-list tuple로 deduplicate하며 삽입 target leaf를 EXCLUSIVE로 잡는다. 분석한 nbtree 경로는 buffer SHARE_EXCLUSIVE를 쓰지 않고 pinned buffer API에도 SX→X promotion은 없다.","database":"postgresql","revision":"fd2b89854d93d70fe8c9a69d5b8fafd5b9302cfc","kind":"source","confidence":"SOURCE-CONFIRMED","source_refs":[{"path":"src/backend/access/nbtree/README","symbol":"heap TID","line_start":42,"line_end":49,"file_sha256":"f5a705fae0ac5e5f9261bf5d08ae037dba6fcb0c25bf098dca94ba92b00b65c6","evidence_state":"COMMIT"},{"path":"src/include/access/nbtree.h","symbol":"posting list","line_start":433,"line_end":458,"file_sha256":"a0ecee3dbf06a1ce089162dc6ef03395f935d1e1ad9d720bb21551b7df6704ce","evidence_state":"COMMIT"},{"path":"src/backend/access/nbtree/nbtdedup.c","symbol":"_bt_dedup_pass","line_start":34,"line_end":99,"file_sha256":"9efa244f0a24c65e582ae692f404c2e8c8b4f78b02428bffa55ea883b2ec9191","evidence_state":"COMMIT"},{"path":"src/backend/access/nbtree/nbtinsert.c","symbol":"_bt_doinsert","line_start":105,"line_end":170,"file_sha256":"0ef3d779ec130b82bd2658c32d71085a629d218e91808e929ee0d0dc43baa617","evidence_state":"COMMIT"},{"path":"src/backend/storage/buffer/bufmgr.c","symbol":"BufferLockAcquire","line_start":5921,"line_end":5935,"file_sha256":"e06ef92568b542148fda10ecae264c7451a52c0269182d1403d0ec6a31837732","evidence_state":"COMMIT"},{"path":"src/backend/storage/buffer/bufmgr.c","symbol":"SharedBufferBeginSetHintBits","line_start":6992,"line_end":7058,"file_sha256":"e06ef92568b542148fda10ecae264c7451a52c0269182d1403d0ec6a31837732","evidence_state":"COMMIT"}],"runtime_run_ids":[],"limitations_ko":"negative usage conclusion은 pinned nbtree 및 buffer lock source 범위에 한정한다. GIN posting tree는 구조상 더 가까운 partial analogy지만 기본 scalar B-tree가 아니며 S/X만 사용한다.","report_locations":["chapters/08-postgresql.html#postgresql-analysis","chapters/10-comparison.html#cross-database-comparison"]}
{"id":"MYSQL-C007","claim_ko":"InnoDB non-clustered index는 user secondary fields에 clustered-key columns를 더해 개별 secondary record를 B-tree leaf에 삽입한다. leaf record 수정은 X latch를 쓰며 tree/block SX는 구조 변경 coordination이라 CUBRID overflow OID first-fit chain과 같은 경로가 아니다.","database":"mysql","revision":"06a5c1c99c377fc41b2eba1ea244e8b220bdc3c8","kind":"source","confidence":"SOURCE-CONFIRMED","source_refs":[{"path":"storage/innobase/dict/dict0dict.cc","symbol":"dict_index_build_internal_non_clust","line_start":3227,"line_end":3321,"file_sha256":"df5821177012072c52fa659600c5035baa9f51107aa8f1cf073ffc2dfa6c769e","evidence_state":"COMMIT"},{"path":"storage/innobase/row/row0ins.cc","symbol":"row_ins_sec_index_entry_low","line_start":2806,"line_end":3082,"file_sha256":"4663213c4e443450323908184eae6477c63cf5e376cfa7385b3400fcc19c4f30","evidence_state":"COMMIT"},{"path":"storage/innobase/include/btr0btr.h","symbol":"btr_latch_mode","line_start":64,"line_end":83,"file_sha256":"7c7322362fa53751242cf4129c5e5803420e3c0240f8823b934d8fd90b8ed691","evidence_state":"COMMIT"},{"path":"storage/innobase/sync/sync0rw.cc","symbol":"LOCK COMPATIBILITY MATRIX","line_start":55,"line_end":106,"file_sha256":"2e061541ccba8a682461f8601746172a407c0a2cba44b678782483960d053c34","evidence_state":"COMMIT"},{"path":"storage/innobase/sync/sync0rw.cc","symbol":"rw_lock_x_lock_low","line_start":445,"line_end":507,"file_sha256":"2e061541ccba8a682461f8601746172a407c0a2cba44b678782483960d053c34","evidence_state":"COMMIT"}],"runtime_run_ids":[],"limitations_ko":"InnoDB에는 page/block SX와 index-level SX가 모두 있으나 여기서는 non-spatial secondary insert와 generic rw-lock compatibility만 비교한다. CUBRID chain 최적화의 runtime 근거가 아니다.","report_locations":["chapters/09-mysql.html#mysql-analysis","chapters/10-comparison.html#cross-database-comparison"]}
{"id":"CMP-C006","claim_ko":"같은 저카디널리티 B-tree key의 physical duplicate representation은 CUBRID의 head-linked overflow OID chain, PostgreSQL의 TID-ordered bounded leaf posting tuples, InnoDB의 clustered-key를 포함한 개별 secondary records로 달라 직접 대응물이 없다. PG/InnoDB SX는 호환성 한 축의 partial analogy일 뿐 CUBRID chain 탐색 개선을 검증하지 않는다.","database":"comparison","revision":"f799e05d77d5300c6ea5753b4a6cc7caee6d8912","kind":"analogy","confidence":"SOURCE-CONFIRMED","analogy_class":"no equivalent","source_refs":[{"database":"cubrid","path":"src/storage/btree.c","symbol":"btree_find_free_overflow_oids_page","line_start":12137,"line_end":12179,"file_sha256":"547c44afb9ed2d86eca95744b3118ab5eee566ba48a779690ffe92abc75993b3","evidence_state":"COMMIT"},{"database":"postgresql","path":"src/include/access/nbtree.h","symbol":"posting list","line_start":433,"line_end":458,"file_sha256":"a0ecee3dbf06a1ce089162dc6ef03395f935d1e1ad9d720bb21551b7df6704ce","evidence_state":"COMMIT"},{"database":"mysql","path":"storage/innobase/dict/dict0dict.cc","symbol":"dict_index_build_internal_non_clust","line_start":3227,"line_end":3321,"file_sha256":"df5821177012072c52fa659600c5035baa9f51107aa8f1cf073ffc2dfa6c769e","evidence_state":"COMMIT"}],"runtime_run_ids":[],"limitations_ko":"이는 storage representation의 no-equivalent 판정이다. S/SX/X compatibility 자체는 partial analogy이며 timing, latch lifetime과 workload behavior까지 같다는 뜻은 아니다.","report_locations":["chapters/10-comparison.html#cross-database-comparison"]}
